    "detailed_description": "<strong>Chapter 2: Bus Explosion Incident</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Summary:</h2>An explosion suddenly occurred on a bus heading to the suburbs, leaving the scene in complete disarray. All 10 passengers, including the sales clerk, on board were killed.<br><br>Lin Shanhai led the on-site investigation team to thoroughly examine the scene and interview all the deceased's family members and friends, but the case remains a complete mystery.<br><br>He decides to recreate the real situation inside the bus prior to the incident and use deductive reasoning to analyze it.<br><br>Everything comes down to the crucial 10 minutes.<br><br>You will enter this tense 10-minute loop<br>and use deductive reasoning to crack the<br>mystery of this explosion case. Analyze<br>every detail - uncovering the truth will<br>bring the culprit to justice!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay:</h2>Players must first search the crime scene for clues, then piece together the evidence in the mind map to uncover the truth. You can use the clue radar to locate physical evidence, and the clue analyzer to assist with deduction when uncertain about a clue.",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Chapter 2: Bus Explosion Incident</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Summary:</h2>An explosion suddenly occurred on a bus heading to the suburbs, leaving the scene in complete disarray. All 10 passengers, including the sales clerk, on board were killed.<br><br>Lin Shanhai led the on-site investigation team to thoroughly examine the scene and interview all the deceased's family members and friends, but the case remains a complete mystery.<br><br>He decides to recreate the real situation inside the bus prior to the incident and use deductive reasoning to analyze it.<br><br>Everything comes down to the crucial 10 minutes.<br><br>You will enter this tense 10-minute loop<br>and use deductive reasoning to crack the<br>mystery of this explosion case. Analyze<br>every detail - uncovering the truth will<br>bring the culprit to justice!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay:</h2>Players must first search the crime scene for clues, then piece together the evidence in the mind map to uncover the truth. You can use the clue radar to locate physical evidence, and the clue analyzer to assist with deduction when uncertain about a clue.",
    "short_description": "The bus to the suburbs suddenly exploded, the scene was a mess, the sales staff, including all 10 people on board died. Lin Shanhai led the scene investigation team to conduct a detailed investigation and visited all the families and friends of the deceased, but the case is still no clue.",
